{"sba-keyaki-4684":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHBGX2QT0YV5AB3QYE5GE2Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○今日の朝ごはん○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨーグルトと卵だけで\nフレンチトーストを作りました\\( ˆoˆ )/\n(牛乳がなくて)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トッピングにはちみつとバナナ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"糖質を控えようと\nヨーグルトと卵だけで作りましたが\nヨーグルトに酸味があるので\n砂糖を入れれば良かったなと後悔\nでもバナナとはちみつが甘いので\n普通の人には丁度いいかも!\n私は甘党なので♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フレンチトーストで世界は平和になる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなフレンチトーストを食べよう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのふわふわ感は\nきっと世界中の人々を幸せにする!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHBGY2VVZ4TGA8HZGKTMQ2X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「moomin stand」行ってきた ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡にいた時から行きたかったの!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHBGZ2ZB8VT13A18GJA1EM6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が飲んだのは人気No.1のミックスベリーミルク!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりするくらい美味しかった!!おすすめ(●︎´∀︎`●︎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中にはベリー味のたね「ニョロニョロベリー」が入ってるよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってみてけろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-8755":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新遅れてごめんなさい\n待っててもらえたかな......？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな事が沢山あったから、１つずつ行きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、名古屋のマンモスフリーマーケットのイベントに出させていただきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中、沢山の方が来てくださっててビックリしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいてないですか？\nコメントにも体調くずしてるって書いてあったから、早く良くなるようにまあやパワー送ります〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られない方の気持ちもいつも\nもらえて嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑新曲衣装\nリクエストがあったので、広島弁で.........     "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「この衣装ぶち可愛いいじゃろ〜！可愛くない！ってゆうたら、はぶてるんじゃけ〜な〜！」...笑笑笑\n広島弁で書いてみたけど...伝わるかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーの新曲、\n《春のメロディー》も発披露させてもらったりしたよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"    可愛い曲で、ダンスも可愛いので、もっともっと皆に見てもらいたいな〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー同士で、フリーマーケットいきたいねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかって話してたんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か買って帰った方がいますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は《似顔絵会》\n皆さんの似顔絵を書かせて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてて思ったけど、まあやは絵が下手だ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな絵で楽しんで帰ってもらえたのかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...汗汗\nでも、あんなに長く一緒に居れる事が出来て、まあやは楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、あの会場は久しぶりでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あそこでオーディションがあって、\nお見立て会があって、\n控え室もオーディションの時と同じで、オーディションの時を思い出しました\n なんだか当分前の事みたいに感じた..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時の気持ちを思い出しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあそこの会場でイベントとかしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、教えてくれてありがとうございます。...ブログ更新一周年..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも励ましてくれて、勇気を沢山もらったから今までやってこれたよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と同じように大切な人達です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが幸せな気持ちになるから、\nその何倍も幸せになってほしいです\n本当にいつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" これからも、よかったら、まあやと一緒に楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえるように、まあやは努力するよ!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな\nゆみ姉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうとう来てしまった...\n     前みたいに乃木坂として一緒にお仕事することはないと思うけど、お互い頑張ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとまあやのお姉ちゃんだからね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹の事心配して遊びに来てね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉の印象は \n        ゲーム＆大人\nって感じ、見るたびにゲームしてた〜笑\nでも相談すると大人の考えを持ってるから凄く勉強になるし、ゆみ姉には、なんだか社会の勉強を教えてもらった感じがするなぁ←歴史とかそういうのじゃないよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"           大人の社会みたいな感じ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、絶対に遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"       こんど泊まりに行きたいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと大好きな乃木坂のお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"                       ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！前回のセクシーな脚は...\nいつも私達の心に元気をお届けものしてくれる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん〜！でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":" BYE "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/20/8325887/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-54261":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n おもち\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFMRQWJ889H76VAQ2T2FEP6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 遅ればせながら\n \n 今月で、写真集の発売から一年と\n 25歳の誕生日を迎えることが\n できました！\n \n 地元の友達から懐かしい写真が。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFMRRVXPWZRE2PHBXDZVJ5H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n わ〜\n 乃木坂1年目と2年目の誕生日です！\n \n ちょうど高2、高3の時期で\n 離れ離れになったクラスのみんなが\n 教室から写真を送って\n お祝いしてくれたんですよね...\n \n 16歳で東京にきてから、25歳になるまで\n 沢山の人に支えられて、恵まれながら\n 頑張ることができて本当に濃い時間でした\n \n \n \n 24歳の一年は、がむしゃらに頑張る\n と言うよりも、ひとつひとつ、\n 人との繋がりや出会いに感謝したり、\n いまの自分を、一歩一歩、\n 確かめながら進めることができた\n とても貴重な一年でした\n \n \n その時間は、いまの自分にとって\n すごく大事なもので\n 周りの人には感謝でいっぱいです\n \n 沢山有難うです\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFMRSVZ986AVPECYB5DZZH0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 2019年もあと3日！\n \n 2020年も皆さんが\n 幸せでありますように\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFMRV7SRCJB03CYA2RPNHSG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 昨日、12／27 発売\n 『乃木坂46×週刊プレイボーイ2019』\n \n ぜひ！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFMRW76EM4W2KJKCXCRM1ZW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n さゆ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-31517":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から4月だね！\nやっと春が来てくれて涙出る。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカジャン欲しいけど、デザイン迷う。\niPhon_SE いいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日エイプリルフールだけど、\n嘘考えるの面倒だからわたしは平和に～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかいは正義です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から新しいこと頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2016/04/01/7290294/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんω♥︎"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-37510":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーの衣装\n同じ生地のセットアップちょーかわいい(^o^)！\nパンツがタック入りなの好き\n個人的に、なんとなくジョジョっぽいなぁって思う！\nでも腰部分の生地の張りがモンハンのレウスの装備っぽくも見える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2017/03/21/0533426/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り付けもかっちょいい！\nけど緊張する〜\nカメラ目の前に来て あきらかに自分 ワンショットで撮られてるって思うと力入っちゃう〜\nみんなでダンス揃うと 綺麗なので\nがんばります✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pv\nリアルなフサフサの 猫耳。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.n